WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.260 --> 00:00:04.820
[THE EU IS COMMITTED TO CUT EMISSIONS
BY AT LEAST 55% BY 2030]

00:00:04.820 --> 00:00:11.220
[THE ENERGY SECTOR IS KEY
BECAUSE IT PRODUCES 75% OF OUR EMISSIONS]

00:00:11.220 --> 00:00:16.900
[WE NEED TO USE LESS ENERGY
AND WE NEED CLEANER ENERGY SOURCES]

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:22.540
[BY 2030 40% OF THE ENERGY USED IN THE EU
SHOULD COME FROM RENEWABLE SOURCES]

00:00:22.540 --> 00:00:27.780
[WE SHOULD USE AT LEAST 9% LESS ENERGY
THAN CURRENTLY PLANNED]

00:00:27.780 --> 00:00:34.180
[ENERGY TAXATION SHOULD BE BASED ON
THE ENVIRONMENTAL IMPACT OF THE FUELS WE USE]

00:00:34.180 --> 00:00:40.900
[TAXES ON CLEAN FUELS SHOULD BE LOWER
THAN TAXES ON MORE POLLUTING FUELS]

00:00:40.900 --> 00:00:46.100
[WE WILL REMOVE THE TAX EXEMPTIONS
FOR KEROSENE FUEL FOR PLANES]

00:00:46.100 --> 00:00:53.020
[AND HEAVY OIL FOR SHIPS
ON JOURNEYS WITHIN THE EU]

00:00:53.020 --> 00:01:00.020
[THE MOST POLLUTING FUELS
SHOULD HAVE THE HIGHEST TAXES]

00:01:00.200 --> 00:01:02.660
[BUT THERE WILL BE EXEMPTIONS]

00:01:02.660 --> 00:01:06.860
[FOR VULNERABLE
AND ENERGY POOR HOUSEHOLDS]

00:01:06.860 --> 00:01:11.060
[FOR THEIR HEATING FUELS
AND ELECTRICITY]

